{{Quote|Inspired by the legendary armored cavalry of the First Galactic War, this lightweight suit features integrated acoustic dampeners to shield the wearer from the deafening roar of Freedom, and the disruptive screams of dissidence.|[[Armory]] Description}}

'''BFM-16 Tanker''' is a set of [[light armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from the 1st page of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|30|notext}} and {{Currency|Medals|45}} respectively.

== Passive Ability ==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Blunt-Force Mitigation}}

