== Trivia ==
* The BFM-16 Tanker bears a resemblance to Soviet-era Tanker Helmets, specifically, the top of the helmet having similar details to the [[fandom:equipment:TSh-4|TSh-4M]]. Notably, this helmet is missing the ear coverings, leaving the headset exposed.

